@startuml TemplateGeneration
title Model-selected MCP checking: author or existing candidate
autonumber
actor User
participant Application as App
participant Domain
participant "Provider / model" as Model
participant MCP
User -> App: Domain + authoring request or existing candidate
App -> Domain: Generation or check-planning instructions, schema, allowed names
App -> MCP: List definitions once per job
MCP --> App: Frozen schemas and versions
App -> Model: Author: proposal + plan; validate: plan only
Model --> App: Requested response with nonempty fixed plan
loop Author: up to 3 attempts; validate: 1 attempt
    App -> Domain: Build generated candidate or retain supplied candidate; bind inputs
    App -> App: Freeze candidate identity; reset pending names
    loop Bounded native tool turns until no checks pending
        App -> Model: Pending callable schemas + prior evidence
        Model --> App: Tool name + check-specific arguments
        App -> App: Enforce plan; reject overrides; inject candidate
        App -> MCP: Validated arguments, pinned tool version
        MCP -> Domain: Run selected validation operation
        Domain --> MCP: Result details or validation failure
        MCP --> App: Structured evidence or protocol error
        App -> App: Record result; continue after failures
    end
    alt All selected checks passed
        App -> Model: Final evidence; acknowledgement only
        App -> Domain: Finalize from candidate and evidence
        Domain --> App: Artifact, or missing canonical evidence
        App -> App: Stop retrying
    else Author failed and attempts remain
        App -> Model: Complete evidence + request revision
        Model --> App: Revised proposal, same check membership
    else Attempts exhausted or supplied candidate failed
        App -> Model: Final evidence; acknowledgement only
        App -> App: needs_review; no reusable artifact
    end
end
App --> User: Status, latest proposal, complete history, optional artifact
note over App, User
checked is technical success, not user approval.
Missing canonical data: needs_review.
Incomplete/protocol conversation: error with partial history.
Final acknowledgement failures are recorded separately.
Human approval persistence remains follow-up work.
end note
User -> App: Generate preview from reusable artifact and seed
App -> Domain: Deterministic expansion
Domain --> User: Question; no AI or MCP call
@enduml
